{"title":"Stunning Artemis II Phone Wallpapers","link":"https://kottke.org/26/04/stunning-artemis-ii-phone-wallpapers","date":1775664376000,"content":"\n         \t<p>NASA has made available <a href=\"https://www.nasa.gov/artemis-ii-mobile-wallpapers/\">more than a dozen mobile wallpapers of photos taken during the Artemis II mission for free download</a>. Basic Apple Guy has <a href=\"https://basicappleguy.com/haberdashery/artemis-ii-iphone-wallpapers\">made some wallpapers of his own</a> (that are slightly larger than NASA’s and better for iPhones). I have also made a few of my own: <a href=\"https://kottke.org/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,metadata=none/plus/artemis-wallpapers/artemis-ii-wallpaper-07.jpg\">Earth Rising Over the Moon With the Orion Capsule in the Foreground</a>, <a href=\"https://kottke.org/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,metadata=none/plus/artemis-wallpapers/artemis-ii-wallpaper-08.jpg\">A Sliver of Earth Over the Moon</a>, and <a href=\"https://kottke.org/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,metadata=none/plus/artemis-wallpapers/artemis-ii-wallpaper-09.jpg\">Kubrickian Earth</a>.</p>\n\t<p>Here are a few of my favorites:</p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663256-1372e57e.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663256-1372e57e.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663256-1372e57e.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663277-030655d6.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663277-030655d6.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663277-030655d6.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663325-b090e2af.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663325-b090e2af.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663325-b090e2af.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>Interstitial tip: if you’re using an iPhone with iOS 26, tap the Spatial Scene button when you’re editing your wallpaper and the phone will turn any of these images into a 3D-ish scene that moves when you move your phone. Works best with images containing multiple objects (like the Earthrises). Makes you feel a little bit more like you’re there. (<a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@asdacenko/post/DW2IJkkjTQt\">This is also an amazing setup</a>.)</p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663372-f190c8a6.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663372-f190c8a6.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663372-f190c8a6.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663395-ac29eae7.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663395-ac29eae7.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663395-ac29eae7.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663417-f1c0ee34.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663417-f1c0ee34.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663417-f1c0ee34.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663431-8cce63a7.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663431-8cce63a7.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663431-8cce63a7.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663450-73fb9df9.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663450-73fb9df9.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663450-73fb9df9.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663496-ba6a09bc.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663496-ba6a09bc.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663496-ba6a09bc.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>These are all real photos, cropped from the originals shared by NASA <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/nasa2explore/\">on Flickr</a> and <a href=\"https://www.nasa.gov/artemis-ii-multimedia/\">their website</a>.</p>\n\t<p>I also went back and looked at some of the images from <a href=\"https://www.nasa.gov/humans-in-space/view-the-best-images-from-nasas-artemis-i-mission/\">the Artemis I mission</a>, which sent an Orion capsule around the Moon without a human crew. Here are a few wallpapers made from photos from that mission: <a href=\"https://kottke.org/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,metadata=none/plus/artemis-wallpapers/artemis-i-wallpaper-01.jpg\">Earth Moon Capsule</a>, <a href=\"https://kottke.org/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,metadata=none/plus/artemis-wallpapers/artemis-i-wallpaper-02.jpg\">Lens Flare Trio</a>, and <a href=\"https://kottke.org/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,metadata=none/plus/artemis-wallpapers/artemis-i-wallpaper-03.jpg\">Lunar Surface</a>.</p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775661520-a87d1b61.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775661520-a87d1b61.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775661520-a87d1b61.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775661548-955e2438.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775661548-955e2438.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775661548-955e2438.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663199-5c49e850.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663199-5c49e850.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1775663199-5c49e850.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>Again, these three are from the Artemis I mission in late 2022. The first one works especially well with the Spatial Scene mode on iOS 26.\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/artemis\">artemis</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/astronomy\">astronomy</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Earth\">Earth</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/iPhone\">iPhone</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Moon\">Moon</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/NASA\">NASA</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/science\">science</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"3a524acc62f72299e7a1b7b4cc310159302204a3ac679e62b1dbb52ce0c0e64b","category":"Sites"}